1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:20,000
AI teams spend money on engineers and compute hoping a model gets better.
GradientMine is a bug bounty marketplace for AI models.

2
00:00:20,000 --> 00:00:45,000
A model owner freezes the failure, metric, minimum improvement,
evaluator, deadline and reward before workers compete.

3
00:00:45,000 --> 00:01:15,000
This repository includes a real CPU proof:
84.72% to 95.28%, across 360 held-out examples.

4
00:01:15,000 --> 00:01:45,000
Public development feedback helps workers iterate.
Hidden verification and frozen rules decide who wins.

5
00:01:45,000 --> 00:02:10,000
Bounded artifacts, hashes, signatures, architecture and shape checks
create an inspectable boundary for untrusted submissions.

6
00:02:10,000 --> 00:02:35,000
Solana handles escrow, registered recipients,
authorized settlement and timeout refunds.

7
00:02:35,000 --> 00:02:50,000
Compute markets sell GPU time.
GradientMine sells the outcome: measurable AI improvement.
